OL,3,AGeorgia officials hunt for suspect in
OL,4,Ashooting that killed two and injured 35
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestigators in the US state of
OL,7,FGeorgia are on the hunt for a suspect
OL,8,Fin a mass shooting that erupted in the
OL,9,Fearly hours of Sunday, killing two
OL,10,Fpeople and injuring 35 more.
OL,12,FA crowd of roughly 1,000 people had
OL,13,Fgathered for a block party in the
OL,14,Fsouthern rural community of Vienna
OL,15,Fwhen, according to officials, more than
OL,16,F50 shots were fired.
OL,18,FTwo of the victims were pronounced dead
OL,19,Fat the scene, while another 25 were
OL,20,Ftransported to multiple nearby
OL,21,Fhospitals, some in critical condition.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
