OL,3,AGeorgia officials hunt for suspect in
OL,4,Ashooting that killed two and injured 35
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo known arrests have been made and
OL,7,Fauthorities have not given a possible
OL,8,Fmotive for the violence. Victims ranged
OL,9,Fin age from 14 to 51.
